      <description><![CDATA[<p>Winter comes to the city: frost on grass and roofs on cold mornings, lingering in the shade.</p>
<p>Lakes and bays freeze over after a cold spell, from the shore out, and snow stays on the ground.</p>
<p>Frosty days are lit by a pale, cold sun with blue shadows.</p>
<p>New weather choice: Frost and Ice.</p>]]></description>
